! TEST 17: GDI VVOD — prompt, Unicode, invalid number, Esc
GRAF
CFON 1
CSIM 15
CLSC
A = 42
B = 77
$0 = 'Moscow'
STRO 3
STLB 3
VVOD 'Age (old 42): ';A
VVOD 'City (old Moscow): ';$0
VVOD 'Cancel value (old 77), press Esc: ';B
STRO 12
STLB 3
LIST 'Age =';A
LIST 'City =';$0
LIST 'B after Esc =';B
LIST 'Press Enter to finish'
WAIT
TEXT
EXIT